OL,3,GNEWSAOvercrowded Romford A&E secures
OL,4,A#42m for rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn overcrowded A&E department in east
OL,7,FLondon is to be rebuilt after its NHS
OL,8,Ftrust secured #42m for the work.
OL,10,FThe emergency department at Queen's
OL,11,FHospital in Romford opened in 2006 to
OL,12,Ftreat 325 patients a day but regularly
OL,13,Fsees more than twice that number,
OL,14,Faccording to Barking, Havering and
OL,15,FRedbridge University Hospitals NHS
OL,16,FTrust (BHRUT).
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
