OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOvercrowded Romford A&E secures
OL,4,A#42m for rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said the rebuild would create
OL,7,Fdedicated waiting areas, which the
OL,8,Fdepartment currently lacks, and cut the
OL,9,Fwalk from the hospital entrance to the
OL,10,Fadult A&E department from 335 steps to
OL,11,Fabout 50.
OL,13,FInterim chief executive Fiona Wheeler
OL,14,Fcalled it a "landmark moment" for
OL,15,Fpatients and staff.
